<title>SINGAPORE: CDL, Republic Hotels Singapore land bid rejected.</title>
<headline>CDL, Republic Hotels Singapore land bid rejected.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Singapore $55.5 million bid by City Developments Ltd  and Republic Hotels &amp; Resorts Ltd for a 24,282 sq metre plot of land in Singapore has been rejected, the Urban Redevelopment Authority (URA) said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The bid for the hotel and commercial site at Fullerton Square, Singapore's central business district, was rejected as the price was much lower than the government's assessment, a URA statement said.</p>
<p>It said URA was reviewing plans for the site.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
